wercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229781,"global_rank":112953,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19561},{"name":"naomi789/tamagotchi","owner":"naomi789","html_url":"https://github.com/naomi789/tamagotchi","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Similar to but different from Tamagotchi - a grad school project","topics":[],"score":229778,"global_rank":112997,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19562},{"name":"codefellows/pph-helping-yourself","owner":"codefellows","html_url":"https://github.com/codefellows/pph-helping-yourself","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Partner Power Hour: Helping Yourself - Effectively Getting Assistance","topics":[],"score":229775,"global_rank":113001,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19563},{"name":"Gibbons-Lab/Metagenomic_Biomass_Quantification_2024","owner":"Gibbons-Lab","html_url":"https://github.com/Gibbons-Lab/Metagenomic_Biomass_Quantification_2024","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Scripts for gut bacterial biomass analysis","topics":[],"score":229767,"global_rank":113015,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19564},{"name":"denshoproject/namesdb","owner":"denshoproject","html_url":"https://github